    "title": "Fore wing images of Bombus cryptarum, B. lucorum, and B. terrestris",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19703357",
    "publication_date": "2026-04-23",
    "description": "<p>The dataset consists of 814 fore wing images of three species of <em>Bombus</em>: <em>B. cryptarum</em>, <em>B. lucorum</em>, and <em>B. terrestris</em>. The wing images represent 423 specimens. The wing images are compressed in Bombus_cry_luc_ter-wing-images.zip. Raw coordinates of 19 landmarks marked on the wings are in file Bombus_cry_luc_ter-raw-coordinates.csv. Position of the landmarks describes Bombus-landmarks.png.</p>",
